  "releaseNotes": "- Separates per-Run temporary directory context from stable Agent instructions\n  so consecutive Codex turns retain their native conversation\n- Restores AgentOS-owned history when changed Codex instructions or host tools\n  require a replacement native thread, including an existing conversation's\n  first turn after upgrade\n- Keeps temporary cleanup failures from blocking saved workspace restoration\n  or cleanup of other completed tasks; safely retires registered empty\n  directories while retaining unverified contents and retry records\n- Preserves checkpoint failure protection, original inputs, persistent outputs,\n  and active task isolation without adding operator settings\n- Reuses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.23` and existing sandbox templates unchanged",
